    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement for rifampicin in the supplied cards.",
    "No matched oral-versus-IV comparator for the query or a close rifampicin analog.",
    "No rifampicin-specific solubility or permeability record; the only rifamycin-related L4 record is rifaximin solubility, which has limited structural transferability.",
